# /srv/<name>/system-check.env on the server (mode 600, owner deploy), beside
# backup.env: the healthchecks.io check bin/system-check pings every 15
# minutes. Shell syntax, names only here; the value never goes in the
# repository.
HC_SYSTEM_PING_URL=
# Optional: the name Caddy serves, and the Compose services that must run.
# SITE_HOST=www.lumenviae.org
# SERVICES="app db office caddy"
